d.\n\nReason: Playing the ♣2 is the best strategic move because it maintains the integrity of the two high pairs (KK, AA), which is the most efficient way to clear the hand. Breaking the pairs would result in a weak hand structure composed mostly of singles.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣2"]}'}
